{"about_the_game":"Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora\u2122 is a first-person, action-adventure game set in the Western Frontier. Abducted by the RDA, you, a Na\u2019vi, were molded to serve their purpose. Fifteen years later, you are free, but find yourself a stranger in your birthplace. Reconnect with your lost heritage and discover what it truly means to be Na'vi as you join other clans to protect Pandora.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE A WORLD OF WONDER AND DANGER</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/AVATAR_600x345_GIF_01.gif?t=1736259377\" /><br>Experience the epic wonders of the Western Frontier, a never-before-seen continent of Pandora. Journey through beautiful yet unpredictable open world regions, where lowering your guard can lead to deadly mistakes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME NA\u2019VI</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/AVATAR_600x345_GIF_02.gif?t=1736259377\" /><br>Harness your incredible strength and agility while customizing your character, crafting new gear, and upgrading skills and weapons to fit your playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOAR THE SKIES</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/AVATAR_600x345_GIF_03.gif?t=1736259377\" /><br>Bond with your own personal banshee that will give you an edge in aerial combat and can be used for traveling across the vast Western Frontier.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER MULTIPLE COMBAT STYLES</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/AVATAR_600x345_GIF_04.gif?t=1736259377\" /><br>Fight off the dangers of Pandora as you embrace the precision of traditional Na\u2019vi weapons, including your bow and spear-thrower, or leverage your human training with more destructive weapons, such as an assault rifle or a shotgun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SHARE YOUR ADVENTURE IN FULL CAMPAIGN CO-OP</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/AVATAR_600x345_GIF_05.gif?t=1736259377\" /><br>Play the full story campaign in single-player or with a friend online in two-player co-op.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Our Reclamation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/74885b3597b9655cdd03128cbba0e1e92428c272.jpg"},{"name":"No Easy Prey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/51c808dc1f7028d77650c595f1f72b1dc24a5350.jpg"},{"name":"Talk to the Ancestors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/3bff93d063e1fd810697cc9be944d90a773f844a.jpg"},{"name":"Sprouting Potential","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/823b6c3d49c60330170e21be2d8de7857aea5f95.jpg"},{"name":"Full Bloom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/314dd652ecb42969dc6502b7c56ee7648b88d932.jpg"},{"name":"Tethered Kites","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/d9b41bdaa3c0a893bc7e0ed9e6aaba58b45684a9.jpg"},{"name":"First Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/50f5010aefee7cbb8667b8a320d819d4eb1e3cb2.jpg"},{"name":"Aranahe Alliance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/3acb842e6f45979a6490befbcae8511031577ba3.jpg"},{"name":"Stronger Together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/b97b900f87aff1df7c65a09e88983287e61d7bdf.jpg"},{"name":"Clearing the Mist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/a8c26da7d8e0a0d6cea3ca1cbd6ed3d2b25adbed.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun