https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/AVATAR_600x345_GIF_04.gif?t=1736259377\" /><br>Fight off the dangers of Pandora as you embrace the precision of traditional Na\u2019vi weapons, including your bow and spear-thrower, or leverage your human training with more destructive weapons, such as an assault rifle or a shotgun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SHARE YOUR ADVENTURE IN FULL CAMPAIGN CO-OP</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/AVATAR_600x345_GIF_05.gif?t=1736259377\" /><br>Play the full story campaign in single-player or with a friend online in two-player co-op.","developers":["Massive Entertainment \u2013 A Ubisoft Studio"],"dlc":[2857260,3005010,3005000,2857300,3231160],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-tamper<br>5 a day machine activation limit","ext_user_account_notice":"Ubisoft Account (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/header.jpg?t=1736259377","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora TM & \u00a9 2023 20th Century Studios. Game software \u00a9 2023 Ubisoft Entertainment. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257026836,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257026836/movie480.mp4?t=1717782621","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257026836/movie_max.mp4?t=1717782621"},"name":"Accolades Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257026836